B.a_U=new A.aj(B.EV,["Welcome!","Enter your name to start memorizing representatives.","First Name","Language","Representatives","Start","Cancel","Change","Delete","Add Profile","Who's Learning?","Browse","Quiz","Results","Settings","Search members...","Search members...","Filter","Sort","Sort by Last Name","Sort by Least Memorized","Sort by Most Memorized","Party","Region","All","Practice Subset","Mode","Name Match","Choose the name for a face","Party Match","Choose the party for a face","Riding Match","Choose the riding for a face","Name Recall","Type the last name for a face","Face Match","Identify the face for last name","Final Test","Type the name, party, and riding for a face.","Has Duplicate Last Name","Submit Answer","Name","Last Name","Riding","Select Riding:","Correct!","Incorrect!","Answer: ","Next","Finish","Score","No members found with these filters. Please loosen your criteria.","No members found.","No quiz results to show yet.","Duplicate Last Names","Duplicate","Proceed","Credits","\ud83d\ude80 Data & Web Services","Thanks to ","OpenNorth"," for their great Represent API. \ud83c\udf0d","\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Legislative Assemblies","As well, thanks to each of the legislative assembly websites from across Canada.","\ud83d\ude4c Special Thanks","Finally, big thanks to Gavin Davis and Owen Mackenzie (HoC Pages 2026-2027) for their feedback in developing this app. \ud83d\udca1","\ud83d\udcec Feedback welcome!","Issues","Privacy","Privacy Policy","This application respects your privacy. \n\n1. Data Collection: We collect minimal data necessary for the app to function, including your chosen first name and quiz results. \n\n2. Storage: Data is stored locally on your device and synchronized with our secure Firebase backend for leaderboard and progress tracking purposes. \n\n3. Third Parties: We use Firebase (a Google service) for data storage and hosting. No data is sold to third parties. \n\n4. Your Rights: You can delete your local data at any time via the Settings menu. For backend data deletion, contact us at guydavis.ca@gmail.com. \n\n5. Compliance: This policy is designed to comply with Canadian privacy standards (PIPEDA).","Close","Loading representatives...","Enhancing with latest status...","Share","Share Result","Recommend to a Colleague","Check out MemReps! It's a great way to memorize the names of Canadian MPs and Senators. \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\udde6 https://gavindavis.ca/memreps","Toggle Color / B&W"],t.li)
